# CLOUDFLARE PAGES DEPLOY EXCLUSIONS
#
# !!! `.gitignore` DOES NOT PROTECT A DEPLOY.  `wrangler pages deploy site`
# uploads what is on disk, not what is tracked, so a directory that is safely
# out of the repo can still be published to the open internet.  This file is
# what keeps it off.
#
# !!! lookup_eval/ IS NOW PUBLISHED, AND THIS EXCLUSION IS GONE (2026-08-02).
# It said: 441 MB of dictionary data whose redistribution licences are
# unconfirmed, or which §9 excludes as a voice however it is licensed.  The
# reader has since settled the terms it was waiting on -- DPD is CC BY-NC-SA
# 4.0, the Abhidhāna and PEU are a Gift of Dhamma, free distribution only, and
# each of those notices now travels with its source in the panel.  The
# remaining PCED dictionaries are published on the reader's own judgement; the
# open questions are recorded in _panel/rights_and_tooltips.md, not hidden.
#
# NOTE FOR ANYONE READING THIS FILE AS A GUARD: it is not one, on this site.
# `wrangler pages deploy` is not how buddha-dhamma.net is published --
# .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml uploads site/ from a clean checkout, so
# what is TRACKED is what ships, and .gitignore is the only thing that decides.

# Working copies and backups that have accumulated beside the real files.
*.bak_*
*.pre*
*.prerebuild
*.prerepair
*.damaged_by_*
